The doorbell rings.
I open the door and see Timo and Lena.
"Hello you two, come in!" I call cheerfully.
"Hello Maya, thanks for the invitation," says Lena.
Timo holds up three bottles of beer.
"We brought cold Berlin beer with us," he says.
"That is perfect, thank you!" I answer.
I take their jackets.
I hang them on the coat rack in the hallway.
Afterwards I point to my small dining table.
The table is already neatly set.
"Go ahead and sit down!" I say to them.
Then I go briefly into the kitchen.
I fetch three glasses for the beer.
"Mmh, that smells good," Timo calls from the table.
"The food is also ready in a second," I answer happily.
